WEBVTT

00:05:59.956 --> 00:06:02.476
And each of these regrets, to my mind,

00:06:02.476 --> 00:06:07.036
reveals something fundamental
about humanity and about what we need.

00:06:07.076 --> 00:06:08.276
We need stability.

00:06:08.276 --> 00:06:10.676
Nobody wants to have an unstable life.

00:06:10.676 --> 00:06:14.796
We want a chance to learn
and grow and do something.

00:06:14.836 --> 00:06:18.196
We recognize that we are not here forever,

00:06:18.236 --> 00:06:20.596
and we want to do something
and try something.

00:06:20.636 --> 00:06:24.756
And at least feel
the exhilaration of being bold.

00:06:25.516 --> 00:06:27.676
Moral regrets, I think most of us,

00:06:27.716 --> 00:06:30.316
almost all of us
want to do the right thing.